## Learned Patterns

### Naming Conventions
- Epics: `E{n}: {Title}` (e.g., "E1: ACM Data Extraction Pipeline")
- Stories: `E{epic}-S{story}: {Title}` (e.g., "E1-S1: Create ACM Data Model")
- Labels: `acm-ai-v2` for all v2 issues, `legacy-v1` for old architecture

### Field Usage
- Priority mapping: P0 = Highest, P1 = High
- Labels used: `acm-ai-v2`, `extraction`, `frontend`, `ai`, `export`, `branding`, `design`, `victorian-bar`

### Relationship Patterns
- Epics use parent field for Story relationships
- Stories linked to Epics via `parent` field during creation

